|Engtitle=CELEBRATION
|Eng =<poem>
Our story will definitely go on and on
As long as you smile by my side
I want nothing at all
Though this cruel helpless world won’t change
But let’s celebrate every day we’ve come so far
Let the song of celebration sound

We’ve come a long way
There were the days I couldn’t see what I was looking for
With this pure thought,
I used to sing because I wanted to be accepted by others

Just like a kid not knowing the pain,
I hurt someone innocently
I guess I was bluffing so I wouldn’t be drowned out
I’ll carry all the regrets with me
To the end of the line, to be proud of myself

Our story will definitely go on and on
As long as you smile by my side
I want nothing at all
Though this cruel helpless world won’t change
But let’s celebrate every day we’ve come so far
Let the song of celebration sound

Some people chose to leave
Sometimes our heart didn’t match
We’ve talked to each other about so many of our dreams
Those words that we exchanged in tears
I’ll remember them in my heart
I’m gonna move on now

Our story will definitely go on and on
Holding together the sadness and the pain
Embraced them all to this day
The tragedy goes on today somewhere in the world
But come on, let’s find the meaning of happiness
Let the song of celebration sounds

We can't be anything
We're struggling to be "what we want to be"
The first step we took was the future
I only want one thing, for you to be able to look forward
I’m leaving this sound as the evidence

Our story will definitely go on and on
As long as you smile by my side
I want nothing at all
I’ll embrace it and will share it with you
Let the song of celebration sound

Lalala
Lalala</poem>
